'''''Humming Antlers, Entwined Horns''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Enter the Artisanship Commission to see what is happening
# Ask about the situation from the crowds at the Artisanship Commission entrance
# Enter the Artisanship Commission to see what is happening
# Investigate how far the Ambrosial Arbor's roots have breached into the Artisanship Commission
# Follow Master Gongshu
# Destroy the entangled Ambrosial Arbor coil and free the Shifting Screen
# Head to the Creation Furnace
# Investigate the Artisanship Commission, and find the source of the Ebon Deer's rejuvenation
# Return to the Creation Furnace and defeat the Abundant Ebon Deer
# Investigate the Artisanship Commission, and find the source of the Ebon Deer's rejuvenation
# Destroy the entangled Ambrosial Arbor coil
# Find the third Ambrosial Arbor coil
# Destroy the entangled Ambrosial Arbor coil

