===Investigate how far the Ambrosial Arbor's roots have breached into the Artisanship Commission{{subst:void|<!--102110103-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Artisanship Commission|update|As the Ambrosial Arbor is reborn, its massive root system spreads outward, roaming everywhere like writhing dragons. Delves situated closer to the Arbor are far more likely to be breached.<br />The roots of the Ambrosial Arbor tightly wrap around a giant furnace in the Artisanship Commission, lifting it off the ground, and the bridge leading to that location has already been destroyed.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''???:''' Upon Commission grounds your feet do tread! Leave from whence you came or soon be dead! Deaaaad!!!
:'''???:''' Stay away! If you come any further, I'll not spare you!
;(Enter battle)
::{{tx|Enemy list missing}}
----
:'''???:''' Golden Cloud Toad! Illumination Dragonfish! ...Are you alright? Wake up! I raised you like my own flesh and blood...
:'''???:''' Did you really have to destroy my little friends? I want compensation!
:'''March 7th:''' You didn't want to listen to us! We were here to rescue you and you started a fight for no reason!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you Master Gongshu?
::'''Master Gongshu:''' How do you know my name, child?
::'''Master Gongshu:''' Does the reputation of Gongshu Liang, "the smelter extraordinaire," precede one?
::'''March 7th:''' This guy is pretty deluded for a "master..."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you Awei's teacher?
::'''Master Gongshu:''' Hmph! Did those hopeless brats send you here? It won't work! They abandoned the Commission's precious assets and ran off to save their own little skins!
::'''Master Gongshu:''' Even if you rescue me, it won't change anything &mdash; all of them will fail their internships!
::'''March 7th:''' ...It's not like that. You're making this too complicated...
:'''Welt:''' We're passing through on our way to the Alchemy Commission at the behest of General Jing Yuan and Diviner Fu. We'd like you to show us the way, Master Gongshu.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' R&mdash;Really? The general sent you? Then this must be a mere misunderstanding! Ah &mdash; don't worry about those things, easy to fix!
:'''Master Gongshu:''' But there's not much I can do to help! The Artisanship Commission was suddenly taken over by some evil tree demon. It seized our most precious possession &mdash; the Creation Furnace!
:'''Master Gongshu:''' It's a dark and powerful entity. The robots... it was like they gained consciousness &mdash; they were moving in a circle around it. I fear approaching it is tantamount to suicide!
:'''Master Gongshu:''' But then, I couldn't just run away... knowing what lies sealed in the furnace...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're short on time. Where are we going? Who are we fighting?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} One good turn deserves another.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think I know where this one is going...
:'''Master Gongshu:''' Haha, I'm sure General Jing Yuan must have believed wholeheartedly that you could save the Artisanship Commission from this crisis.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' Means I know of may yet serve your fight, pray you in repayment aid my plight. Come! Come on, through here~
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Follow Master Gongshu{{subst:void|<!--102110120-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Artisanship Commission|update|No one expected an old master to remain at his post in this abandoned delve. His spirits are applaudable.<br />You learn that this man, Master Gongshu, is concerned about the furnace's safety. However, he alone could do little against the rampaging roots. As virtuous and just trailblazers, such a task would be a piece of cake for you!}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Master Gongshu:''' Look, this is one of the Artisanship Commission's prototypes: The Shifting Screen.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' Good thing I got the students to take it out and make a few adjustments &mdash; otherwise they'd never have managed to get out in time.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' You all saw the Jade Gate on your way in, I assume? The Shifting Screen works in the same way. It connects two spatial coordinates in ways that laymen, ahem, wouldn't understand.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Like teleportation?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Then what do you need starskiffs for?
:'''Master Gongshu:''' Indeed. With limited range and energy costs aside, to every starskiff soon shall woe betide~!
:'''March 7th:''' You sure about that? Even our trailblazing Space Anchors sound better.
:'''Tingyun:''' Thank goodness you take the time to perfect these inventions, master! If not, the Sky-Faring Commission would've become quite redundant by now.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' Ordinarily I could've used this beauty to teleport you thither, but... Through earth and air the wretched branches boiled, the Shifting Screen entangled thence... encoiled!
:Gongshu Liang strikes a pose and raises an eyebrow as if to say: "keep asking."
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm sure you know how to fix it.
::'''Master Gongshu:''' How observant &mdash; you would make an excellent student.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thanks for the colorful explanation. Bye!
::'''Master Gongshu:''' H&mdash;Hold on! Have some faith in me!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Then I shall inform the general that this path is a no-go.
::'''Master Gongshu:''' H&mdash;Hold on! My young friends, don't underestimate the Artisanship Commission. The general is too far off to help us now, but I can!
:'''Master Gongshu:''' The Commission is more than a match for mother nature. Hmph! O piteous tree, who think thyself so strong, your match and more in strength to meet ere long...
----
:{{Black Screen|Master Gongshu sets up the equipment hastily}}
:'''Master Gongshu:''' This is the first thing that came to mind when the tree demon attacked.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' It's a mechanical device code-named the Luminflux Pyxis.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' I invented this weapon for the Cloud Knights. It's incredibly powerful, but...
:'''Welt:''' Let me guess... Limited range? Energy costs?
:'''Master Gongshu:''' *sigh* Every light has its shadow. But this is more than enough to deal with the tree demon.
:'''Master Gongshu:''' And then, ignite. Fire beats wood &mdash; there's no way we can lose!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

